{"id":"1b2ccbfd02ba2f92","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions.md","title":"P、ZPP、RP、NP 的包含关系","display":"thm-random-complexity-inclusions — P、ZPP、RP、NP 的包含关系","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions","aliases":["73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions"],"display":"thm-random-complexity-inclusions — P、ZPP、RP、NP 的包含关系","depends_on":["[[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]]","[[73-df-binary-p]]","[[73-df-binary-np]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.8, Theorems 11.18–11.19, print pp. 511–512; PDF pp. 533–534","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-complexity-inclusions — P、ZPP、RP、NP 的包含关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0afef8eeccddc023\" href=\"?note=0afef8eeccddc023\" title=\"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection\">73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.8, Theorems 11.18–11.19, print pp. 511–512; PDF pp. 533–534"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P,\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf P,\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span> 为本册二进制多带时间类；随机类采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0afef8eeccddc023\" href=\"?note=0afef8eeccddc023\" title=\"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection\">73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection</a> 的语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{ZPP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{ZPP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>确定机可忽略每次随机位，所以 P⊆ZPP。中间包含由交等式。RP 机的每个分支都在同一多项式界内停机；NTM 猜测相同随机位，正实例有接受序列，负实例完全没有，得到 RP⊆NP。所有包含均非已知真包含的断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf P,\\mathsf{NP}$ 为本册二进制多带时间类；随机类采用 [[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]] 的语义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf P,\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{ZPP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1328,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-random-complexity-inclusions|P、ZPP、RP、NP 的包含关系]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["0afef8eeccddc023","5a23e63a72e2443c","ebe5483ba604bc90"]}